[0.318117, "o", "\r\n\u001b[36m──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[36m\u001b[1m  fairchem-mcp · equation of state · fcc Cu\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[36m──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n  Sweep the cell volume, fit an equation of state, read off the\r\n  equilibrium volume, cohesive minimum, and bulk modulus.\r\n\r\n  calculator: \u001b[32mEMT\u001b[0m  (fast/qualitative; set FAIRCHEM_MCP_EXAMPLE_MODEL for UMA)\r\n"]
